    description: "The mountainous belt of Shivaliks in Haryana has a rich diversity of medicinal plant species. Situated in village Chuharpur on the Yamunanagar &#8211; Paonta road. In view of the increasing market demand for medicinal plants, both national and international and to exploit the commercial potential of medicinal resources of this region, Ch. Devi Lal Herbal Nature Park has been developed at Chuharpur in district Yamunanagar. It is instrumental in conservation and propagation of the resource base of medicinal plant material in Haryana.",
