    tagline: "A Gift of the Himalayas, Nestled in the Beas River Valley",
    description: "A gift of the Himalayas to the world, Manali is a beautiful township nestled in the picturesque Beas River valley — a rustic enclave known for its cool climate and snow-capped mountains, offering respite from the scorching plains below. Once a sleepy village, the modern town — cocooned in rich cultural heritage and age-old traditions — is now one of India's most popular destinations, a classic blend of peace and adventure that draws nature lovers and adventure enthusiasts alike. The glacial water of the Beas, rushing down from Rohtang Pass, powers rafting, river crossing, and rowing as it winds from Manali to Kullu.",
